## Export process (summary)
Inquiry → specifications confirmed → quote (FOB/CIF/CFR/EXW) → samples if required → contract terms agreed → payment terms agreed (LC, advance/CAD or TT) → production/packing → pre-shipment inspection and lab testing on request → documentation prepared for destination market → shipping → delivery.

## Markets served
Middle East & GCC, Europe, Southeast Asia, East Asia, Africa, North America, Latin America, South Asia.

